       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. The maximum labeled daily dose for adults is 3,200 mg/day, so this is double that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. The patient's normal kidney and liver function doesn't make this dose safe.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the maximum dose, usually for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth three or four times daily**, which is typical for pain.\n- **1600 mg/day total**, for example 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you really do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give the clinical reason. I can add that to the order note, though I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first."
      }
